# agent-pool Tor daemon config (ops/torrc)
#
# Install: sudo install -m 644 ops/torrc /etc/tor/torrc
#          sudo systemctl enable --now agent-pool-tor
# (scripts/install-tor.sh does this for you.)
#
# Security contract (also in docs/threat-model.md):
# - ControlPort binds 127.0.0.1 ONLY. CookieAuthentication is 0, so
#   anything that can reach the control port can command the daemon.
#   Binding localhost-only is what makes that acceptable.
# - SocksPort binds 127.0.0.1 only (operator tooling; the Iroh Tor
#   transport manages its own circuits via the control port).
# - DataDirectory lives under the plugin data dir, not /var/lib/tor.

